; Independent AI board audit of session-wide neutral semantic frequency sense.
; The Form-native review flow persists every answer before collection.
import "../form/form-stdlib/core.fk"
import "review-panel.fk"
import "review-ask.fk"

(ra-review
  "cognition/session-neutral-semantic-frequency.fk"
  "Adversarial implementation review; do not edit any file. Read cognition/session-neutral-semantic-frequency.fk, cognition/tests/session-neutral-semantic-frequency-band.fk, observe/session-neutral-semantic-frequency-live.fk, cognition/response-word-field-dictionary.fk, cognition/concept-text-roundtrip-10000-13.fk, and cognition/form-neutral-word-field.fk. Freshly preflight and run the native band if useful. Verify that every observed token remains distinct from semantic coverage and 13-axis field coverage; that a first multilingual surface hit is used only to address the complete collision group; and that all byte-identical concept candidates, source states, effective definitions, sense counts, and occurrence frequencies remain available. Pressure-test Indonesian ya ambiguity, !/*/#/=> structural ambiguity, operator merging, all printable ASCII punctuation, exact residue addresses, numbers, unsupported locales, and empty inputs. Check that corpus occurrence frequency is never called semantic frequency. Check that definition-projection-v1 excludes functional response glue and does not impersonate an intrinsic, empirical, moral, universal, or speaker-reviewed word geometry. Verify the representative measurements rather than trusting the prose: 22/22 observed and semantic with 12/22 field evidence for the NL fixture, 7/7 observed and semantic with 5/7 field evidence for the PL fixture, 13/13 lexical locale roundtrips for trust, and the band verdict 33554431. Treat the byte-honest convenience tokenizer as not providing Chinese/Japanese segmentation and require caller-supplied segmented tokens there. Distinguish complete printable-ASCII structural coverage from all Unicode symbols, all PL operators, arbitrary identifier semantics, common meme-phrase semantics, or all-language session understanding. Return PASS AS A BOUNDED SESSION TOKEN-TO-NEUTRAL-CANDIDATE OBSERVER, REVISE, or BLOCK. Locate executable defects or overclaims and name the smallest coherent repair; style advice is secondary.")
